{"id":31184,"slug":"anthem","title":"Anthem","year":1991,"country":"United States","duration":8,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/31184-anthem","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/85c52899a6a25ec00fcb03d8fc912a9d/plZLBLDmkunHHkEPgNfYcBA6ExkIHI_large.jpg","description":"“Pervert the language.” Made at a time when Marlon Riggs was three years into living with HIV and the motto “Silence=Death” was the queer community’s defiant response to the antigay policies of the Reagan era, this experimental music video employs a mix of poetry, African beats, and provocative imagery—sexual, political, and religious—in order to challenge and redefine prevailing images of Black masculinity. Led by the liberated dancing of the filmmaker himself, Anthem is a bold vision of queer revolution, proclaiming “Every time we kiss we confirm the new world coming.”","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Marlon Riggs","slug":"marlon-riggs"}],"cast":[{"actor":"The Bella Boys","role":"Featuring","slug":"the-bella-boys"},{"actor":"Djola Bernard Branner","role":null,"slug":"djola-bernard-branner"},{"actor":"Brian Freeman","role":null,"slug":"brian-freeman"},{"actor":"Jesse Harris","role":null,"slug":"jesse-harris"},{"actor":"David Barron Kirkland","role":null,"slug":"david-barron-kirkland"},{"actor":"Willi Ninja","role":null,"slug":"willi-ninja"},{"actor":"Tim Riera","role":null,"slug":"tim-riera"},{"actor":"Marlon Riggs","role":null,"slug":"marlon-riggs"},{"actor":"Essex Hemphill","role":"“American Wedding” performed by","slug":"essex-hemphill"},{"actor":"Colin Robinson","role":"“Unfinished Work” performed by","slug":"colin-robinson"},{"actor":"Reginald T. Jackson","role":"Contributing poets","slug":"reginald-t-jackson"},{"actor":"Steve Langley","role":null,"slug":"steve-langley"},{"actor":"Donald Woods","role":null,"slug":"donald-woods"},{"actor":"Blackberri","role":"“America” performed by","slug":"blackberri"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person